      "blocks": {
        "15d9d2f4-1bdd-49c8-9a99-58246020f05c": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "title": "About B'spoke",
            "question_1": "Q: “What products does B'spoke offer? ”",
            "answer_1": "<p>B'spoke offers a diverse range of wellness solutions, including supplements, healthy drinks, baby food, and health foods. Our products are designed to address wellness goals such as boosting immunity, supporting gut health, enhancing energy, and more—each crafted to deliver safe and effective results.</p>",
            "question_2": "Q: “How are B'spoke products different than others?”",
            "answer_2": "At B'spoke, we do not compromise with your health. We use only the best ingredients, no matter how much they cost. All our products undergo rigorous quality checks and are lab-tested at different stages. All our supplements are manufactured in an FDA-registered facility.",
            "question_3": "Q: “Why are B'spoke products more expensive than others? ”",
            "answer_3": "We use the best form of the best available ingredients, sourced from around the world. Each ingredient is lab-tested for quality and efficacy. Moreover, the finished products undergo lab testing to ensure that heavy metals, allergens, and microbes are not present in the final product. This rigorous process adds to the cost, which is reflected in the price of our products.",
            "question_4": "Q: “Why should I trust B'spoke?”",
            "answer_4": "You can write to us at help@bspokewellness.com, and we will share all the test reports for the product you purchased. Soon, we will launch a portal where you can check the test and quality reports for your batch of products by entering the batch number.",
            "question_5": "Q: “You mentioned that your supplements are formulated based on RCT-based clinical trials. Why don't you share the research with us? ”",
            "answer_5": "All the research is available on our platform. Simply log in, and you can access the research and studies supporting our products.",
            "question_6": "Q: \"Can multiple products be combined?\"",
            "answer_6": "Yes — products are designed to stack synergistically (e.g., Anti-Spike + Omega-3).",
            "question_7": "Q: \"Do B’spoke products work for all ages?\"",
            "answer_7": "Most are suitable for 18+, with some exceptions for teens based on product type.",
            "question_8": "Q: \"How soon do results appear?\"",
            "answer_8": "Varies by product — from 2 weeks for probiotics to 12 weeks for skin and metabolic changes.",
            "question_9": "Q: \"Are there any side effects?\"",
            "answer_9": "Minimal; the formulas use gentle, natural, clinically validated ingredients.",
            "question_10": "Q: \"How does B’spoke ensure safety?\"",
            "answer_10": "Through multi-step quality checks: ingredient sourcing → lab testing → GMP manufacturing → final product validation."
          }
        },
        "paragraph_j8pgxF": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "title": "About B'spoke Products",
            "question_1": "Q: “Are B’spoke products clinically researched?”",
            "answer_1": "<p>Yes — formulations are based on ingredients supported by randomized controlled trials (RCTs).</p>",
            "question_2": "Q: “Are these products FDA-registered?”",
            "answer_2": "Manufacturing occurs in FDA-registered facilities.",
            "question_3": "Q: “Are the products lab-tested? ”",
            "answer_3": "Every batch undergoes stringent third-party purity, potency, and contamination testing.",
            "question_4": "Q: “Are ingredients sourced globally?”",
            "answer_4": "Yes — only premium, globally certified suppliers are used.",
            "question_5": "Q: “Are the products WHO-GMP certified? ”",
            "answer_5": "Manufacturing follows WHO-GMP standards.",
            "question_6": "Q: \"Are the products safe for long-term use?\"",
            "answer_6": "<p>Yes — within recommended doses.\n</p>",
            "question_7": "Q: \"Are B’spoke products non-GMO?\"",
            "answer_7": "Yes — clean, non-GMO ingredients are used.",
            "question_8": "Q: \"Are the supplements halal?\"",
            "answer_8": "Yes — Halal certification appears on the brochure.",
            "question_9": "Q: \"Are the products free from heavy metals?\"",
            "answer_9": "Yes — every batch undergoes contamination testing.",
            "question_10": "Q: \"What makes B’spoke different from other brands?\"",
            "answer_10": "Higher potency, RCT-backed formulations, premium standardized extracts, and advanced delivery formats."
          }
        },
