          "settings": {
            "title": "Orders and Shipping",
            "question_1": "Q: “How do I place an order?”",
            "answer_1": "Shopping with us is simple. Browse our products, add your selections to the cart, and complete the checkout process. You will receive a confirmation email once your order is placed successfully.",
            "question_2": "Q: “How long does shipping take?”",
            "answer_2": "Orders are typically fulfilled within 2–3 business days. Delivery times vary depending on your location.",
            "question_3": "Q: “How can I track my order?”",
            "answer_3": "Once your order is shipped, you will receive a tracking link via email or SMS. Use this link to monitor your order’s progress.",
