          "settings": {
            "title": "Returns and Refunds",
            "question_1": "\"What is your return policy?\"",
            "answer_1": "<p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;\">\n    We offer a <strong>7-day free return policy</strong> for eligible products.<br><br>\n    <strong>To request a return:</strong><br>\n    Log in to your account and submit a return request.<br>\n    Our team will review your request within <strong>24–48 business hours</strong>.<br>\n    Once approved, a courier will pick up the product from your registered address within <strong>7 business days</strong>.<br><br>\n    <strong>Terms of Return:</strong><br>\n    Products must be in their original packaging and unused.<br>\n    Refunds will not be processed if the product has been used or damaged during the return period.<br>\n    Products purchased during sample sales are non-returnable.\n</p>",
            "question_2": "\"How are refunds processed?\"",
            "answer_2": "<p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;\">\n    <strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Refunds will be processed within <strong>10–12 business days</strong> post-inspection. Share your bank details at \n    <a href=\"mailto:help@bspokewellness.com\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: underline;\">help@bspokewellness.com</a>.\n    <br><br>\n    <strong>Online Payment:</strong> Refunds will be credited to your original payment method within <strong>7 business days</strong> post-inspection.\n</p>",
